      ## Traits

      ***Bloodied Frenzy.*** While ***Bloodied***, the berserker has ***Advantage*** on attack rolls and saving throws.

      ## Actions

      ***Greataxe.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Greataxe]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d12+3,dicelabel=Damage [Greataxe]) Slashing damage.

